{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here","id":483074,"title":"I don't have a good title here","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-16T19:12:19-07:00","id":483074,"title":"I don't have a good title here","content":"My dad just died.<br /> <br /> I was at work. I had just clocked out a little late; I usually get overtime on Thursdays because of my work schedule. He called my sister's girlfriend and told her he was having chest pains and wanted to go to the hospital, but not right away because he needed to change his shirt. It was soaked through with sweat, he said. She told him to chew some aspirin and be waiting outside for her. She got the children into the car as fast as she could and got over there; I doubt he waited six whole minutes. When she got there, he was pale and indeed drenched. She's an RN, so she knows what's what.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell my kids I love them,&quot; Dad said, and got into the car. As best I can figure, this is the moment when my sister called me. I was already driving home, but it wasn't a big deal to turn around and get to the ER.<br /> <br /> They tried to keep him talking during the drive. He explained he'd been out gardening, planting some strawberries. He chatted as best he could, but about two miles away from the hospital, he stopped. My sister's girlfriend stopped the car, pulled him out onto the shoulder of the road, and began administering CPR while my niece shrieked and wept and panicked. My sister's girlfriend called 911 and got an automated loop telling her to remain on the line and an operator would be with her shortly. She tried flagging down every car that passed, including two sheriff's cars, but the only one that stopped was a fairly useless (though good-hearted, for which I honor him) man who really couldn't assist but was willing to listen to the 911 busy signal until a dispatcher finally picked up.<br /> <br /> I didn't know the details, but my sister and I knew this was happening because we'd been waiting at the ER for far too long and any attempts to call her girlfriend went straight to voicemail. In that situation, there's only one scenario that really makes sense: She wasn't there because she was pulled over, and she wasn't answering her phone because she was on her phone. To pass the time, my sister called her doctor friends and her nurse friends, and they came down to help.<br /> <br /> An ambulance was dispatched. The EMTs gave him CPR the entire way over. My sister's girlfriend arrived and gave her car keys to one of my sister's nurse friends so she could drive the car somewhere else where the kids wouldn't have to see the scene. Dad was wheeled into the ER, and they worked on him for twenty minutes before calling it.<br /> <br /> They took us back to see him. Death diminished my dad so much. He was very tall when he was alive, but short on the gurney. I don't know how that works. Half of his skin was purple from bruising and the other half was yellow from blood pooling. His eyes were partially open and had nothing there, just glass orbs staring out. It was the most horrible thing I'd ever seen until we closed his eyes, which was worse somehow. I don't know how so don't ask. I touched him on the head and felt nothing moving in there; if you've ever touched a corpse, you know how there's an imperceptible amount of movement in a living thing that shakes and rattles the body. Dad was still, and touching him was like touching a warm but rapidly cooling lump of clay.<br /> <br /> My sister wept. I tried to cry and couldn't really because that's not how it works for me. My sister's girlfriend kept apologizing for not saving him, and I tried to be kind to her, because there's nothing she could have done differently and I don't blame her for anything.<br /> <br /> After a while we left the ER. We went to my sister's house. I stopped first at my dad's to get his dog and his keys so we could lock the place up. I hate that house so much. It is a very Dad house, and I dread the thought of going back to put paid to it.<br /> <br /> I'm going to stop telling this story now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:17:34-07:00","id":483131,"title":"","content":"I'm very sorry to hear your loss. I don't know you well, JimB, so my words don't mean much, but I'll leave them here just so that you can know that one more person has read the words you've written and is there with you in at least a small way.<br /> <br /> Your sister has a real keeper from the sound of it. I hope they're happy together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:27:08-07:00","id":483137,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry to hear that Jim. Is there anything we can do? If you still have my number, you could call me if you need to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:29:58-07:00","id":483138,"title":"","content":"My sister just called. It's 22:24. I I was afraid to pick up the phone, though I don't know what I thought she was going to say. It turns out she had just been called by the organ and tissue donation people, and they needed me to be on board as well. I am. I mean, I hate the thought of them cutting up my dad, but there are living people out there who need his bones and eyes more than he does. God.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483131#post483131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm very sorry to hear your loss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:39:50-07:00","id":483142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483137#post483137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry to hear that Jim.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483137#post483137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there anything we can do?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what it would be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483137#post483137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you still have my number, you could call me if you need to.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do have your number, but I don't want to speak aloud to people right now.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:41:14-07:00","id":483143,"title":"","content":"When I held my dog in her last moments, as they injected her, I saw the transition from living being to just matter. It was perceptible-even if I hadn't been holding her, I could certainly describe the invasive stillness.<br /> <br /> When my father died, I hadn't seen him for a while before hand. Didn't see the corpse for a few days more. So, when I saw him, I was more prepared to see an object, and I saw just that. I'm glad, in retrospect, that no one allowed me to touch it.<br /> <br /> I've meditated on the difference a lot since the end of February, and I've come to a conclusion:<br /> <br /> No one should have to see that transition in anyone, particularly family. The sight of the immediate loss of elan is too harsh a thing to see, I think, and I feel sorry for anyone who is broken by that.<br /> <br /> I'm sorry, Jim. I'm sorry that you saw that transition, and I'm sorry that you have to go through this and more, and I'm sorry that sorrow can't do more here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:41:55-07:00","id":483144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483142#post483142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do have your number, but I don't want to speak aloud to people right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Completely understandable. <br /> <br /> Godspeed, my friend. Godspeed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T22:39:44-07:00","id":483180,"title":"","content":"You have my condolences for you and your family.<br /> <br /> If there is anything I can do, let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T02:17:59-07:00","id":483366,"title":"","content":"Even after reading it I still don't think I can even start to imagine how you felt and feel. I only can say that my heart goes to you and your family. I am so sorry, Jim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T05:42:51-07:00","id":483436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483143#post483143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I held my dog in her last moments, as they injected her, I saw the transition from living being to just matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry about your dog. I don't remember if I told you that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483143#post483143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry, Jim. I'm sorry that you saw that transition, and I'm sorry that you have to go through this and more, and I'm sorry that sorrow can't do more here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483180#post483180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You have my condolences for you and your family.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483366#post483366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even after reading it I still don't think I can even start to imagine how you felt and feel.</div> </div> </div> </div>That may be because the story I wrote is incoherent nonsense.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483366#post483366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I only can say that my heart goes to you and your family. I am so sorry, Jim.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T06:52:58-07:00","id":483511,"title":"","content":"Having just done this twice this past year, I know there's nothing to say and nothing to do until you're ready.<br /> <br /> Let us know when that is.<br /> <br /> Until then, hang in there. I will not lie, it will not get better for some time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T11:16:51-07:00","id":483755,"title":"","content":"The following note was on my dad's kitchen counter, written in his own hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;Check the top drawer of the file cabinet thats under the printer for needed files. Moms papers are in the brown folder by the printer. Her checking account still needs to be split with Mike only.<br /> <br /> I love you all.&quot;<br /> <br /> Beneath that was a stack of papers he'd filled out for a funeral home.<br /> <br /> God damn it, Dad, what did you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T11:27:43-07:00","id":483764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=483755#post483755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The following note was on my dad's kitchen counter, written in his own hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;Check the top drawer of the file cabinet thats under the printer for needed files. Moms papers are in the brown folder by the printer. Her checking account still needs to be split with Mike only.<br /> <br /> I love you all.&quot;<br /> <br /> Beneath that was a stack of papers he'd filled out for a funeral home.<br /> <br /> God damn it, Dad, what did you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>You know that thing about knowing it's your time sometimes......my father-in-law did that shit, too. He had all his shit together about a week before it happened and said a lot of goodbyes the night before it happened. Even picked a day the Baby Bears go to daycare all day so they wouldn't have to be there in the middle of everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T18:22:33-07:00","id":484083,"title":"","content":"I'm so, so sorry for your loss, Jim. It must be so hard on you all, but I know you can get through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T20:51:41-07:00","id":484215,"title":"","content":"I'm so sorry. If you need to talk, just let me know. Wasn't too long ago I lost my dad, so I know somewhat how you feel. Sorry to hear this man...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T09:20:23-07:00","id":484633,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry for your and your family's loss, JimB. Take care.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T09:13:44-07:00","id":486457,"title":"","content":"The visitation is today. The funeral is tomorrow. It may have been a mistake to agree to give a eulogy. After the funeral, I'll take a few days off work and deal with shit. Everyone who extended comfort, thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-21T09:45:07-07:00","id":487378,"title":"","content":"Driving to the cleaner's today to pick up my suit, I became convinced that they had lost it and I got mad at them for that imaginary thing before I even arrived to find out. My emotions are a bit out of control, is what I'm saying, and I noticed myself resorting to very old, abandoned tricks I once used to get a grip on myself, like making mudras. This will be a rough day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-21T09:59:12-07:00","id":487387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/483074-i-don-t-have-a-good-title-here?p=487378#post487378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This will be a rough day.</div> </div> </div> </div>It should be. If it wasn't, you'd be a sociopath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-22T09:33:31-07:00","id":488373,"title":"","content":"I am so truly sorry, JimB. Such suddenness can really wrench everything out of gear and it makes the loss of a loved one that much more difficult.<br /> <br /> <br /> I am truly, truly sorry for your loss....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T04:31:49-07:00","id":497312,"title":"","content":"How are you doing Jim?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T20:27:04-0